---
// Light-only site: force data-theme='light' on <html> before hydration
// so Starlight's dark-mode CSS never applies, regardless of the user's
// OS `prefers-color-scheme` setting or any prior localStorage value.
// Also loads the Vite-bundled client-side Mermaid diagram renderer.
---
<script is:inline>
  document.documentElement.dataset.theme = 'light';
</script>
<script src="../scripts/mermaid-render.js"></script>
